  "name": "Endeavor Ridge Hot Vents Oceanic Processes, 1984-present",
  "description": "Part of an international program to study oceanic ridges, including sediment traps, current meters, and water properties.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Studying oceanic processes in the vicinity of hot vents.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Some data not in regional data centre Risk of Loss: Medium Impact Justification: Long term time series (more than 10 years) Impact of Loss: High Recommended Action: Bring rest of data to archives",
